&lt;p&gt;Hi Dev Community! 👋&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I'm excited to announce the &lt;strong&gt;v2.0.0 release of &lt;code&gt;react-modern-audio-player&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
This release comes three years after the initial release.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After listening to feedback from users and community members, I’ve spent the last few months refactoring the library to be more efficient and developer-friendly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;


  🔗 Quick Links
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href="https://github.com/slash9494/react-modern-audio-player" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://github.com/slash9494/react-modern-audio-player&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Live Demo&lt;/strong&gt;: [&lt;a href="https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/basic-nfrpfq" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/basic-nfrpfq&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;NPM&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;npm install react-modern-audio-player&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
